@startuml
autonumber
actor "PDU Emitter" as Emitter
actor "Client/UI" as Client
actor "Data Acquisition Service" as DataAcq

participant "Kong Gateway" as Kong
participant "UDP NodePort Service" as UDPService
participant "HTTP ClusterIP Service" as HTTPService
participant "HealthController" as HealthCtrl
participant "InternalMetricsController" as MetricsCtrl
participant "UdpListenerService" as Listener
participant "DisMetricsTracker" as Tracker
participant "PduFactory" as Factory
participant "KafkaProducerService" as Producer
participant "Kafka Broker" as Kafka

== UDP PDU Ingestion Flow ==
Emitter -> UDPService : Sends UDP Packet to NodePort 32000
activate UDPService
UDPService -> Listener : Routes to UDP port 3000
activate Listener

Listener -> Tracker : pduReceived()
activate Tracker
Tracker -> Tracker : Update timestamps and counters
Tracker --> Listener : Metrics updated
deactivate Tracker

Listener -> Factory : createPdu(rawData)
activate Factory
Factory --> Listener : Returns PDU object
deactivate Factory

Listener -> Listener : pduToJson(pdu)
activate Listener
note right: Custom StringBuilder serialization\nfor performance optimization
Listener --> Listener : Returns JSON String
deactivate Listener

Listener -> Producer : sendMessage(json)
activate Producer

Producer -> Kafka : send("dis-pdus", json)
activate Kafka
Kafka --> Producer : Message acknowledged
deactivate Kafka
deactivate Producer
deactivate Listener
deactivate UDPService

== Health Check Flow (Public) ==
Client -> Kong : GET /api/ingestion/health
activate Kong
Kong -> HTTPService : Route to ClusterIP port 8080
activate HTTPService
HTTPService -> HealthCtrl : healthCheck()
activate HealthCtrl
HealthCtrl --> HTTPService : ResponseEntity("Service is up...")
deactivate HealthCtrl
HTTPService --> Kong : HTTP 200 OK
deactivate HTTPService
Kong --> Client : Health status response
deactivate Kong

== Real-time Metrics Flow (Internal) ==
DataAcq -> HTTPService : GET /internal/metrics/realtime
activate HTTPService
HTTPService -> MetricsCtrl : getRealTimeDisMetrics()
activate MetricsCtrl
MetricsCtrl -> Tracker : getMetrics()
activate Tracker
Tracker -> Tracker : Calculate 60-second window stats
Tracker --> MetricsCtrl : RealTimeMetrics object
deactivate Tracker
MetricsCtrl --> HTTPService : ResponseEntity<RealTimeMetrics>
deactivate MetricsCtrl
HTTPService --> DataAcq : Real-time metrics JSON
deactivate HTTPService

== Protected Endpoint Flow (Kong Gateway Authentication) ==
Client -> Kong : GET /api/ingestion/management\nAuthorization: Bearer {jwt_token}
activate Kong
Kong -> Kong : Validate Firebase JWT token
activate Kong
note right: Custom jwt-firebase plugin\nvalidates token with Firebase
Kong --> Kong : Extract user claims
deactivate Kong

Kong -> HTTPService : Forward authenticated request\nwith user headers
activate HTTPService
HTTPService -> MetricsCtrl : Process management request
activate MetricsCtrl
MetricsCtrl --> HTTPService : Management response
deactivate MetricsCtrl
HTTPService --> Kong : Response with data
deactivate HTTPService
Kong --> Client : Authenticated response
deactivate Kong

@enduml